            "end": 92
          }
        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:act#e-9e308eb2c66bfc2c",
          "text": "Writing was so difficult and painful for me that my teacher had allowed me to present my paper on the sinking of the Titanic by acting out a play, where I played all the parts.",
